WEBVTT

00:31:57.538 --> 00:32:02.788
unexpected decision making and judgment
perspectives that I've come across in

00:32:02.788 --> 00:32:04.954
the last few years, in
part because it says,

00:32:05.413 --> 00:32:07.746
I don't always need a second opinion if

00:32:07.746 --> 00:32:09.954
I can get better at forming
my own second opinions.

00:32:10.704 --> 00:32:16.413
Oh, you know, I think as we say
in that chapter sleepover,

00:32:16.413 --> 00:32:22.079
it is really very much the same thing
that is sleepover. And just wait.

00:32:22.621 --> 00:32:24.538
And tomorrow you might think differently.

00:32:25.371 --> 00:32:29.329
So the advice is out there reinforcing it,
maybe useful.